# Agent runtime state (sessions, notepad, plans, logs, handoffs). AGENTS.md
# calls these ignored operational artifacts, but nothing ignored them, so they
# showed up as untracked in every worktree and got staged by a `git add <dir>`
# more than once. Not anchored to the root: they appear per package too
# (apps/web/.omc, router/vectra-controller-pro/.omc, and inside the data-plane
# stand). `.omc/skills/**` is the documented committable exception — force-add
# it with `git add -f` if a project-scoped skill is ever kept here.
.omc/
.codex-runtime/
.playwright-cli/
.playwright-mcp/
.sugar/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

